<title>USA: Powerwave files for 3 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Powerwave files for 3 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Powerwave Technologies Inc said Wednesday that it has filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed public offering of three million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Of the three million, 750,000 of will be offered by the company and 2,250,000 will be offered by shareholders.</p>
<p>The offering will be managed by Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc., UBS Securities LLC and Wessels, Arnold &amp; Henderson LLC.</p>
<p>The net proceeds to the company will be used for capital expenditures, new product development, working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
